OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Sky Blues fans need to know
OL,4,Aabout club's new digital ticket system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last time Coventry City fans were
OL,7,Fin the Premier League, Apple launched
OL,8,FiTunes, allowing users to buy music and
OL,9,Fplay it on their portable devices.
OL,10,FBuying a match day ticket to watch Sky
OL,11,FBlues, though, still meant handing over
OL,12,Fphysical cash in return for a paper
OL,13,Fticket.
OL,15,FTwenty-five years later, and due to
OL,16,Frequirements from the Premier League,
OL,17,Ftickets are now digital and downloaded
OL,18,Fto phones and other mobile tech.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
