OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Sky Blues fans need to know
OL,4,Aabout club's new digital ticket system
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it has led to some confusion
OL,7,Fover how the digital ticketing system
OL,8,Foperates. There has been just one game
OL,9,Fat the CBS Arena so far this season,
OL,10,Fwhich means supporters are still
OL,11,Fgetting to grips with how the new
OL,12,Fscheme works.
OL,14,FIn response, BBC CWR has compiled the
OL,15,Ffollowing guide to what fans need to
OL,16,Fknow, particularly around the issue of
OL,17,Ftransferring tickets.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
